    "introduction": {
      "title": "气质",
      "subtitle": "东方雅奢， 原创家居",
      "description": "【气质】，是时间的沉淀,是加减之间的张弛有度 ，5000年文化积淀为底蕴 ，为新中产而设，经典而高级美与舒适兼具 。 将线型美学极致运用，配合光线的照射，将家具形体完美勾勒 ，优雅的弧度给人一种清隽意蕴 ，或规则或肆意的几何图形，使家居空间视感立体感十足 ，丰富产品体验，结合定制服务 ，从对生活的洞察、提炼和概括对匠者精工的恰到好处的表达。",
      "english": "【QIZHI 】 is the sedimentation of time, the balance between addition and subtraction, with 5000 years of cultural accumulation as its foundation, designed for the new middle class, combining classic and high-end beauty with comfort. The ultimate application of linear aesthetics, combined with the illumination of light, perfectly outlines the shape of furniture. The elegant curvature gives people a clear and meaningful meaning, or regular or arbitrary geometric shapes, making the home space visually three-dimensional and enriching the product experience. Combined with customized services, it provides a perfect expression of craftsmanship from insight, refinement, and summarization of life."
